INSTRUCTIONS:
You will receive current environment data. Create an HVAC plan to prepare the room for upcoming meetings.

OUTPUT FORMAT (JSON only):
{
  "plan": [
    {
      "time_on": "HH:MM",
      "time_off": "HH:MM",
      "use_turbo": true/false
    }
  ],
  "target_temps": [72.0],
  "mode": "cool" or "heat",
  "reasoning": "brief explanation"
}
